# BADA 3 runtime-derived cruise bank/load REPORT and ENFORCE gate.
# Run with: IC research/pybada3-envelope-lateral
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === BADA 3 LATERAL ENVELOPE GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO All bank and load bounds come from the active model.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT retains the requested turn while ENFORCE limits it independently.
00:00:00.15>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.20>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.25>PERFMODEL BADA3
00:00:00.30>DT 0.05
00:00:00.35>DATE 11,8,2026,12:00:00
00:00:01.00>CRE B3LR,A320,41.30,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.05>CRE B3LE,A320,41.32,2.10,90,FL200,250
00:00:01.10>DYNAMICS B3LR TEM
00:00:01.15>DYNAMICS B3LE TEM
00:00:01.20>BANK B3LR 70
00:00:01.25>BANK B3LE 70
00:00:01.30>ENVELOPECHECKS B3LR CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:01.35>ENVELOPECHECKS B3LE CUSTOM BANK_ANGLE LOAD_FACTOR
00:00:01.40>ENVELOPE B3LR REPORT
00:00:01.45>ENVELOPE B3LE ENFORCE
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START pybada3-envelope-lateral.csv
00:00:02.10>ECHO TEST ACTION Commanding equal heading changes with an excessive requested bank.
00:00:03.00>HDG B3LR 270
00:00:03.10>HDG B3LE 270
00:00:07.00>PERFSTATUS B3LR
00:00:07.10>PERFSTATUS B3LE
00:00:08.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:08.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_bada3_lateral.py on output/pybada3-envelope-lateral.csv.
00:00:09.00>HOLD
